WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.618
The water was cold.

2
00:00:17.619 --> 00:00:20.352
Mole could not swim!

3
00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:24.611
"How stupid of me!" Mole thought.

4
00:00:24.612 --> 00:00:28.008
He started to sink.

5
00:00:28.009 --> 00:00:33.761
Just in time, a paw grabbed Mole's fur.

6
00:00:33.762 --> 00:00:39.545
Whoosh! Mole's head popped above the waves.

7
00:00:39.546 --> 00:00:43.110
"Oh!" gasped Mole.

8
00:00:43.111 --> 00:00:45.945
"I've got you," said Rat.

9
00:00:45.946 --> 00:00:48.123
"You'll be all right."

10
00:00:48.124 --> 00:00:52.468
He pulled Mole to shore.

11
00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:56.922
"Rat, I am very sorry," said Mole.

12
00:00:56.923 --> 00:01:00.424
"Don't worry about it," laughed Rat.

13
00:01:00.425 --> 00:01:03.811
"What's a little water to a Water Rat?"

14
00:01:03.812 --> 00:01:10.152
He pulled the boat to shore.

15
00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:13.546
They stepped into the boat again.

16
00:01:13.547 --> 00:01:18.887
This time Mole sat quietly on his cushion.

17
00:01:18.888 --> 00:01:22.937
Rat took the oars and rowed.

18
00:01:22.938 --> 00:01:28.084
"We'll be home soon," said Rat.

19
00:01:28.085 --> 00:01:32.959
Rat's home was a very cozy place.

20
00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:37.384
Its shelves were full of books.

21
00:01:37.385 --> 00:01:40.232
"Sit down and warm up," said Rat.

22
00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:44.137
"I will light a bright fire."

23
00:01:44.138 --> 00:01:48.286
"Ah-choo!" Mole sneezed.

24
00:01:48.287 --> 00:01:52.486
"Here are slippers and a robe," said Rat.

25
00:01:52.487 --> 00:01:54.673
"Put them on, Mole."

26
00:01:54.674 --> 00:01:59.233
Together they ate a fine supper.

27
00:01:59.234 --> 00:02:03.265
Then Rat sat with Mole by the fire.

28
00:02:03.266 --> 00:02:07.842
Rat loved to write songs and poems.

29
00:02:07.843 --> 00:02:12.651
He told Mole many stories of the river.

30
00:02:12.652 --> 00:02:15.962
"You should stay with me," said Rat.

31
00:02:15.963 --> 00:02:19.067
"I'll teach you to row and swim."

32
00:02:19.068 --> 00:02:21.899
"Thank you, Ratty," said Mole.

33
00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:28.606
"You are a good friend!"
